  "title": "Native sm_86 and sm_89 prefill specializations and Group64 A8 prefill: byte-identical attention prefill gains (+4.96% on RTX 4090, +5.40% on RTX 3090 at 130,048 tokens) ship in v0.14.0; Group64 A8 reaches x1.312 C1 and x1.217 130K prefill on RTX 4090 and x1.611/x1.618 C1 and x1.366 130K prefill on RTX 3090 with exact retrieval and matching perplexity, but fails the 200-pair symmetric leak screen on RTX 4090 (a=0, b=5, p=1/32) and stays compiled off on both lanes",
